{"seo":{"title":"Our Story · Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital, Kochi","description":"Every patient is equal. Every patient is heard. Since 1971, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH), Kadavanthra, Kochi, has offered equal respect for everyone and extra support for those who need it most."},"hero":{"image":{"src":"/images/igch-building.jpg","alt":"Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital building in Kadavanthra, Kochi","width":1024,"height":1536},"crumbs":[{"label":"Home","href":"/"},{"label":"About","href":"/about"}],"tag":"Our Story","title":{"before":"Every patient is equal.","accent":"Every patient is heard.","after":""},"lead":"Equal respect for everyone, extra support for those who need it most.","links":[{"label":"Our story","href":"#story"},{"label":"Leadership","href":"#leadership"},{"label":"Team","href":"#team"},{"label":"Achievements","href":"#achievements"},{"label":"Careers","href":"#careers"}]},"stats":{"ariaLabel":"A record of healthcare services, community support and institutional recognition of IGCH.","items":[{"value":"{{free-dialysis}}","caption":"{{free-dialysis.label}}","style":"lime"},{"value":"{{haemodialysis-sessions}}","caption":"{{haemodialysis-sessions.label}}","style":"plain"},{"value":"{{departments}}","caption":"{{departments.label}}","style":"plain"},{"value":"{{specialist-doctors}}","caption":"{{specialist-doctors.label}}","style":"plain"},{"value":"{{hospital-beds}}","caption":"{{hospital-beds.label}}","style":"plain"}]},"story":{"head":{"eyebrow":"Our story","heading":"Where it began: a peoples hospital since 1971","wide":false,"link":{"label":"","href":"#"}},"paragraphs":["In 1971, the people of Kochi came together to build a hospital they could all rely on, whatever their means. Founded by the Cochin Co-operative Hospitals Society, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH), Kadavanthra, Kochi, has grown into an affordable multispeciality co-operative hospital in Kochi, with 30 medical departments. More than fifty years later, it continues to follow the same belief: every patient deserves equal respect and quality healthcare, with additional support for those who need it most.","[Founding members, the original building near Ernakulam South Railway Station, the early years and the new hospital complex inaugurated on 17 September 1986 - additional details need to be collected from IGCH.]","Every patient receives the same respect, dignity and commitment to quality care, regardless of their financial circumstances.","We provide additional support to those who need it most through free and subsidised cancer screening, affordable treatment and free dialysis services."],"society":{"name":"Cochin Co-operative Hospitals Society Ltd.","note":"Registration No. E.288 · IGCH is a unit of the Society"},"timeline":[{"year":"1971","title":"The idea","body":"It started with a group of people in Kochi who wanted to make good healthcare available to everyone, not just those who could afford it."},{"year":"1986","title":"A new home","body":"Shri Rajiv Gandhi inaugurated the new hospital complex on 17 September 1986."},{"year":"[Year]","title":"Super specialities arrive","body":"Cardiology, oncology and other specialist doctors joined, making IGCH a multispeciality hospital in Kochi."},{"year":"[Year]","title":"Accreditation","body":"NABH accreditation [add level] and CGHS empanelment bring recognised quality standards."},{"year":"2026","title":"A New Chapter","body":"A new identity, Kerala’s first 5G Smart Ambulance and a breakthrough in cardiac care with the implantation of the world’s smallest pacemaker."}]},"coop":{"tag":"Our Promise","heading":"Equal respect for everyone, extra support for those who need it most.","points":[{"title":"Equal respect","caption":"Every patient deserves the same dignity, attention and standard of care, regardless of their financial circumstances."},{"title":"Support when it is needed","caption":"Eligible patients can access free dialysis, subsidised cancer treatment and medicines through the hospital's patient support initiatives."},{"title":"Care beyond the hospital","caption":"Our commitment extends into the community through weekly free and subsidised medical camps and free meals for cancer patients, provided in association with the Cochin Cancer Society."}],"ctas":[{"label":"Make a difference","href":"#","style":"primary"},{"label":"How donations help","href":"#","style":"white"}]},"leadership":{"head":{"eyebrow":"Leadership Messages","heading":"The People Leading IGCH Forward","wide":true,"link":{"label":"","href":"#"}},"items":[{"quote":"Collectively, we are driven by a single overriding goal: to make sure that you, your family, friends and neighbours have access to high-quality, high-value care locally, whenever the need arises.","name":"M O John","role":"President, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH)","moreLabel":"Read the President’s message","message":["Dear Friends,","Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital stands as a pillar of excellence and progress in healthcare. For more than 50 years, our dedicated team of doctors, nurses and staff has been unwavering in its mission to strengthen both our hospital and the community we proudly serve. Today, that commitment is stronger than ever, as we continue to advance and adapt to meet the evolving needs of our patients.","Collectively, we are driven by a single overriding goal: to make sure that you, your family, friends and neighbours have access to high-quality, high-value care locally, whenever the need arises.","As president of this institution, I can attest to the fact that IGCH is a “jewel” of an institution with outstanding depth and breadth of clinical capabilities. Beyond these achievements and milestones, we continue to develop and implement new programs and services to provide you with the very best local care possible. If you haven’t been to IGCH recently, I hope you’ll spend time within this site to learn more about our rapidly expanding array of services and capabilities; there truly is no longer any need to travel out of the city for superior health care.","During this time of rapid healthcare transformation, and as one of the fastest-growing hospitals in all of Cochin, IGCH is proud to be recognised as a leader in the field across the Ernakulam District. We are indeed \"so good. So caring. So close\", and with your support, we’ll continue to improve IGCH each and every day so we can better serve you, your family and the entire Ernakulam District.","Sincerely,","M O John","President, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH)"]},{"quote":"The hospital has a vision of becoming an ideal centre for health care for the people around the city and surrounding districts, and not of revenue collection.","name":"[Name]","role":"Secretary, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH)","moreLabel":"Read the Secretary's message","message":["Dear Friends,","I have immense pleasure in welcoming you to Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital [IGCH], a highly progressive and enterprising hospital pledged to providing quality healthcare with great emphasis on traditional values.","Bearing in mind that health is the only tool that uplifts the standard of society, there is a very wide prospect behind providing healthcare by IGCH, Ernakulam. The hospital has a vision of becoming an ideal centre for health care for the people around the city and surrounding districts, and not of revenue collection.","Our dream is to be considered as a pioneer institution of health services, propagating, popularising medical science. We also have a plan to make the base wider to medical, paramedical, nursing and allied fields, which will help in availing medical treatment and health services at affordable cost to the needy ones. The hospital has already arranged the best infrastructure, experienced doctors & nursing staff, modern tools and methodologies.","I firmly believe that health services should foster confidence, discipline, clarity in thought and decision-making at critical stages, and above all, social responsibility as a life-long process.","IGCH takes pride in providing a caring atmosphere to all its patients just apt for the sick minds to be nurtured. It aims to develop scholarly students with great self-discipline, intense perseverance and a zeal to excel, which are the qualities required to meet the challenges of modern society. The hospital seeks utmost co-operation and support at all times to achieve the high standards set, from well-wishers like you.","Thank you.","Secretary","Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH)"]}]},"team":{"head":{"eyebrow":"Team","heading":"Care you can count on","wide":false,"link":{"label":"Meet all doctors →","href":"/doctors"},"lead":"Our doctors work across {{departments}} medical and surgical specialities, with one shared commitment: every patient gets the same attention, clear guidance and good care."}},"achievements":{"head":{"eyebrow":"Achievements & accreditations","heading":"Institutional Recognition","wide":false,"link":{"label":"","href":"#"},"lead":"Donations eligible for tax deduction under Section 80G of the Income Tax Act."},"accreditation":{"tag":"Accreditation","title":"NABH Accredited [level to be confirmed]"},"empanelment":{"tag":"Empanelment","title":"CGHS Empanelled"},"first":{"image":{"src":"/images/ambulance.jpg","alt":"Ambulance on a city road","width":1200,"height":1800},"tag":"A first for Kerala","title":"Kerala's first 5G Smart Ambulance.","body":"Patient data reaches the ER team before the vehicle reaches the door."},"pacemaker":{"image":{"src":"/images/smallest-pacemaker.jpg","alt":"Leadless pacemaker placed inside the heart's right ventricle","width":750,"height":400},"title":"World's smallest pacemaker, implanted without open surgery."},"stat":{"value":"{{cardiothoracic-surgeries}}","caption":"cardiothoracic surgeries in 15 months"}},"careers":{"tag":"Careers","heading":"Make a difference through the work you do.","body":"We welcome applications from qualified and experienced professionals interested in exploring career opportunities at our hospital.","ctas":[{"label":"View Current Openings","href":"/careers#openings","style":"white"},{"label":"Submit Your Resume","href":"/careers#apply","style":"outline"}]},"nursing":{"image":{"src":"/images/nursing.jpg","alt":"Healthcare trainees in blue scrubs practising with a stethoscope","width":1200,"height":800},"tag":"Indira Gandhi College of Nursing","heading":"A four-year B.Sc. Nursing course, taught inside a multispeciality hospital.","link":{"label":"Admissions & eligibility →","href":"/college-of-nursing"}},"sections":[{"id":"impact","eyebrow":"Our impact in Kochi since 1971.","heading":"IGCH: Growth, Achievements and Recognition","paragraphs":["Since its establishment in 1971, Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH) has expanded its medical services, developed its facilities and introduced new healthcare initiatives. Its progress includes advancements in specialised medical care, community health programmes, patient support services and institutional development."],"cards":[{"title":"Medical Care and Achievements","items":["{{haemodialysis-sessions}} Haemodialysis sessions delivered to patients.","{{free-dialysis}} Free dialysis sessions provided to economically disadvantaged patients.","{{cardiothoracic-surgeries.number}} Cardiothoracic surgeries performed within 15 months.","5G Introduction of Kerala's first 5G Smart Ambulance."],"ctas":[{"label":"Explore our Dialysis Centre in Kochi","href":"/facilities/dialysis","style":"light"}]},{"title":"Community Health and Patient Support","paragraphs":["IGCH's co-operative approach to healthcare extends beyond its hospital services through cancer screening, medical camps, patient assistance and public health awareness programs.","Accessible healthcare for those who need it most."]},{"title":"Emergency Care and Medical Infrastructure","paragraphs":["Indira Gandhi Co-operative Hospital (IGCH) has invested in hospital infrastructure, emergency response systems and medical technology to support its range of healthcare services in Kochi."],"ctas":[{"label":"Learn more about our 24-hour Emergency Care in Kochi","href":"/specialities/clinical-support","style":"light"}]},{"title":"Education and Professional Development","paragraphs":["Indira Gandhi College of Nursing provides nursing education through academic programmes and clinical learning opportunities."],"ctas":[{"label":"Nursing College in Kochi","href":"/college-of-nursing","style":"light"}]},{"title":"Accreditations and Recognition","paragraphs":["IGCH's institutional accreditations, healthcare empanelments and professional associations support its hospital operations and patient services."]}]}]}